t the solutions $x=0$ and $x=4.$\n\nTherefore, the intercepts with the $x$-axis are $(0,0,0)$ and $(4,0,0).$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315142 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315143 13194139534855 true] [17592186315142 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315144 13194139534855 true] [17592186315142 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315145 13194139534855 true] [17592186315142 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315146 13194139534855 true] [17592186315142 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315147 13194139534855 true] [17592186315142 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534855 true] [17592186315142 1041 "selection" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315142 1104 #edb/ref 17592186315146 13194139534855 true] [17592186315142 1110 #uuid "4080cdc1-f4d2-50fe-88c6-c80150fc91fb" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315143 1034 "$(-4,0,0)$ and $(4,0,0).$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315143 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315143 1111 #uuid "c28ea49c-006e-5e92-860f-d94069085acf" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315144 1034 "$(0,0,0)$ and $(2,0,0).$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315144 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315144 1111 #uuid "6526dcd7-cf3b-5749-97e9-4f5b36759956" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315145 1034 "$(-2,0,0)$ and $(0,0,0).$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315145 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315145 1111 #uuid "6f19da9a-a976-55db-ba1b-0bb043ee255b" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315146 1034 "$(0,0,0)$ and $(4,0,0)$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315146 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315146 1111 #uuid "57f9e0dc-6c1d-5479-b4c5-05ab74aff856" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315147 1034 "$(-2,0,0)$ and $(2,0,0).$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315147 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315147 1111 #uuid "77546191-1b7f-5baa-874d-a4e9318fb0ea" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315148 1017 #edb/ref 17592186315149 13194139534855 true] [17592186315148 1089 "q-164275" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315148 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534855 true] [17592186315148 1100 "Given the ellipsoid $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{10}+\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{5}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{40}=1$, find its intercepts with the $z$-axis." 13194139534855 true] [17592186315148 1113 #uuid "013c9984-69bc-55ec-a51a-14e22fa98e0b" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315148 1145 "To find the $z$-intercepts, we plug $x=0$ and $y=0$ into the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(0-2)^{2}}{10}+\\frac{(0-1)^{2}}{5}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{40} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{4}{10}+\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{40} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{z}^{2}}{40} & =\\frac{2}{5} \\\\ {z}^{2} & =16 \\\\ z & =\\pm 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we get the solutions $z=-4$ and $z=4.$\n\nTherefore, the intercepts with the $z$-axis are $(0,0,-4)$ and $(0,0,4).$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315149 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315150 13194139534855 true] [17592186315149 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315151 13194139534855 true] [17592186315149 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315152 13194139534855 true] [17592186315149 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315153 13194139534855 true] [17592186315149 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315154 13194139534855 true] [17592186315149 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534855 true] [17592186315149 1041 "selection" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315149 1104 #edb/ref 17592186315152 13194139534855 true] [17592186315149 1110 #uuid "ddef1153-9558-5b74-8ad2-f87a678d6347" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315150 1034 "$(0,0,-16)$ and $(0,0,1)$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315150 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315150 1111 #uuid "c62fd80a-e615-5dd7-8d53-16db17180b29" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315151 1034 "$(0,0,1)$ and $(0,0,16)$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315151 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315151 1111 #uuid "f614a5a2-38f3-5d96-99e4-882716ca9af4" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315152 1034 "$(0,0,-4)$ and $(0,0,4)$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315152 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315152 1111 #uuid "4f31cdba-31ec-56