 1041 "selection" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315156 1104 #edb/ref 17592186315157 13194139534855 true] [17592186315156 1110 #uuid "0e6f3958-59c5-54f9-9454-66e264b97a30" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315157 1034 "The interior and boundary of the circle of radius $3$ centered at $(3,1)$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315157 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315157 1111 #uuid "fa5341f1-ab9b-5010-afbc-cb3a9c297b59" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315158 1034 "The interior and boundary of the circle of radius $3$ centered at $(1,-3)$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315158 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315158 1111 #uuid "05ca48e1-0d8a-5b1c-ad56-1176dfcd9483" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315159 1034 "The interior and boundary of the circle of radius $\\sqrt{3}$ centered at $(-3,1)$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315159 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315159 1111 #uuid "9a5ee55f-54b8-5d95-9002-173b0aacd687" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315160 1034 "The interior and boundary of the circle of radius $\\sqrt{3}$ centered at $(3,2)$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315160 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315160 1111 #uuid "3420634e-0cfa-577e-bd4a-241ef1a74b7d" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315161 1034 "The interior and boundary of the circle of radius $\\sqrt{3}$ centered at $(1,3)$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315161 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534855 true] [17592186315161 1111 #uuid "c18d4fac-d47d-5e9f-be53-772e700e1d62" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315162 1017 #edb/ref 17592186315163 13194139534855 true] [17592186315162 1089 "q-164317" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315162 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534855 true] [17592186315162 1100 "Given the ellipsoid $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{10}+{y}^{2}+\\frac{(z+1)^{2}}{5}=1$, find the domain of $z=z(x,y).$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315162 1113 #uuid "160c2e7f-7903-5bb5-85db-a233663b371d" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315162 1145 "From the ellipsoid equation, we make $z$ the subject as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{10}+{y}^{2}+\\frac{(z+1)^{2}}{5} & =1 \\\\ (z+1)^{2} & =5(1-\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{10}-{y}^{2}) \\\\ z+1 & =\\pm \\sqrt{5(1-\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{10}-{y}^{2})}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the square root is defined only for non-negative arguments, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{10}-{y}^{2}\\ge 0 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{10}+{y}^{2}\\le 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives the interior of the ellipse $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{10}+{y}^{2}=1$ and its boundary. \n\nTherefore, the domain is \n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{10}+{y}^{2}\\le 1}.\n$$" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315163 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315164 13194139534855 true] [17592186315163 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315165 13194139534855 true] [17592186315163 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315166 13194139534855 true] [17592186315163 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315167 13194139534855 true] [17592186315163 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315168 13194139534855 true] [17592186315163 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534855 true] [17592186315163 1041 "selection" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315163 1104 #edb/ref 17592186315167 13194139534855 true] [17592186315163 1110 #uuid "c01f0dcb-19ec-5895-849e-d01f4f8252c1" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315164 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{5}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{10}<1}" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315164 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534855 true] [17592186315164 1111 #uuid "18e88a93-80f6-5024-b2dc-461333550327" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315165 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{5}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{10}>1}" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315165 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534855 true] [17592186315165 1111 #uuid "8ba095ea-13f1-5b07-ab75-d4dbc6b64323" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315166 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{10}<1}" 13194139534855 true] [17592186315166 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534855 true] [17592186315166 1111 #uuid 